    "operationalisation": "PILOT_ONE_PREREG.md s2.2: >=2 of the 3 DECISION axes (triviaqa/popqa/mmlu_content). nq_open DEMOTED by design s5.2, zero decision weight. Exactly 1 of 3 = K2_INDETERMINATE (s2.4), neither fire nor clearance.",
